OL,3,GNEWSAMurder police recover wrecked
OL,4,Avehicle from cliffs
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the murder of a
OL,7,Fwoman in Alderney have recovered a
OL,8,Fwrecked vehicle at the base of cliffs.
OL,10,FThe body of 34-year-old Hannah
OL,11,FBenfield, nee Cox, was found in the sea
OL,12,Fin the west of the island on 28
OL,13,FSeptember and her husband, Simon
OL,14,FBenfield, 44, has been charged with her
OL,15,Fmurder.
OL,17,FGuernsey Police said a vehicle
OL,18,Fidentified at the base of a cliff
OL,19,Fduring a search operation had now been
OL,20,Frecovered.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
