OL,3,GNEWSAMurder police recover wrecked
OL,4,Avehicle from cliffs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said it requested support
OL,7,Ffrom the Ministry of Defence, which
OL,8,Fused a Chinook helicopter to lift the
OL,9,Fvehicle out before it was transported
OL,10,Fto Guernsey.
